---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { countries } from "../data/countries";
---

<Layout 
  title="Tax Calculator - Free Income Tax Calculator, Payroll Calculator & Tax Refund Estimator | TaxPortal" 
  description="Use our free tax calculator to estimate income tax, payroll taxes, tax refunds, and take-home pay. Accurate federal, state, and international tax calculations for 2022, 2023, and 2024. No personal data required."
  keywords="tax calculator, tax return calculator, tax refund estimator, payroll calculator, income tax calculator, tax estimator, federal tax calculator, self employment tax calculator, tax bracket calculator, paycheck calculator, tax withholding calculator, capital gains tax calculator, sales tax calculator, stamp duty calculator, free tax calculator, tax refund calculator, 1099 tax calculator, w4 calculator, federal income tax calculator, tax return estimate, refund estimator, tax estimator 2022, tax estimator 2023, income tax calculator 2022, income tax calculator 2023, federal tax calculator 2022, federal tax calculator 2023, tax refund calculator 2022, tax refund calculator 2023, payroll tax calculator, payroll deductions online calculator, online payroll calculator, paycheck tax calculator, net pay calculator, gross to net calculator, salary after tax calculator, take home pay calculator, effective tax rate calculator, tax liability calculator, taxable income calculator, adjusted gross income calculator, tax withholding estimator, estimate my tax return, calculate my tax return, estimate my refund, tax return calculator 2022, tax return calculator 2023, simple tax return calculator, free tax estimator, online tax calculator, tax simulation, quick tax calculator, tax amount calculator, tax percentage calculator, federal income tax estimator, total tax calculator, tax payment calculator, estimate taxes for 2022, estimate 2022 tax return, tax return estimate 2022, tax return estimate 2023, irs tax calculator, irs refund calculator, irs withholding calculator, turbotax calculator, turbotax tax calculator, hr block tax calculator, h and r block tax calculator, tax act calculator, quick tax refund calculator, federal tax refund calculator, state tax calculator, state refund calculator, state tax return calculator, income tax refund calculator, income tax refund estimator, refund calculator 2022, tax back calculator"
  image="https://finsiva.com/og-image.png"
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-canvas dark:bg-canvas">
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-canvas-soft to-canvas dark:from-primary dark:to-primary" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-20 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl dark:text-on-primary">Free Tax Calculator Suite</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg text-body dark:text-muted">
          Comprehensive <strong>tax calculator</strong> tools for individuals, freelancers, and businesses worldwide. Estimate income tax, payroll taxes, tax refunds, take-home pay, and tax liability with our free, privacy-first calculators.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/countries" class="rounded-pill bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-base font-medium text-on-primary transition hover:opacity-90 dark:bg-on-primary dark:text-primary">Explore All Calculators</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works" class="rounded-pill border border-hairline px-6 py-3 text-base font-medium text-ink transition hover:bg-canvas-soft dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:text-on-primary dark:hover:overlay-light">How It Works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how-it-works" class="border-t border-hairline dark:border-overlay-light">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-ink mb-8 dark:text-on-primary">About Our Free Tax Calculator Tools</h2>
        <div class="prose max-w-none text-body dark:text-muted space-y-6">
          <p>Tax season can be stressful, but with the right tools, estimating your tax liability and planning your finances becomes straightforward. Our free tax calculator suite is designed to simplify every aspect of tax computation for individuals, freelancers, businesses, and tax professionals across multiple jurisdictions. Whether you need a simple income tax calculator for a quick estimate or an advanced tax return calculator with detailed breakdowns, our platform delivers accurate, up-to-date calculations based on official tax slabs, statutory rates, and IRS guidelines.</p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Income Tax Calculator for Every Situation</h3>
          <p>For salaried employees, our federal income tax calculator and paycheck calculator provide detailed insights into your take-home pay. Simply enter your annual salary, filing status, and pay period to see your federal tax withholding, state income tax, Social Security tax, and Medicare deductions. The W-4 calculator helps you optimize your withholding allowances, while the tax withholding estimator ensures you avoid underpayment penalties. If you receive a bonus or commission, our bonus tax calculator estimates the supplemental income tax rate that applies.</p>

          <p>Freelancers, gig workers, and independent contractors face unique tax obligations. Our self employment tax calculator factors in self-employment tax, deductible business expenses, and home office deductions. The 1099 tax calculator handles contractor income, while the estimated tax payments calculator helps you plan quarterly payments to the IRS. For those with multiple income streams, our combined federal and state tax calculator aggregates wages, freelance earnings, and investment income into a comprehensive tax estimate.</p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Property, Capital Gains, and Sales Tax Tools</h3>
          <p>Property owners and investors will find our capital gains tax calculator, property tax calculator, and stamp duty calculator indispensable. The capital gains tax calculator handles both short-term capital gains taxed at ordinary rates and long-term capital gains taxed at preferential rates. Our real estate capital gains tax calculator includes depreciation recapture and exclusion rules for primary residences. The stamp duty calculator estimates transfer taxes on property purchases, while the rental property depreciation calculator helps landlords maximize deductions. The sales tax calculator and VAT calculator support both inclusive and exclusive calculations for domestic and cross-border transactions, making them essential for retailers, e-commerce sellers, and international buyers.</p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Payroll Calculator for Employers and Employees</h3>
          <p>Business owners can use our corporate tax calculator, payroll tax calculator, and employer payroll taxes calculator to estimate entity-level taxes and employment costs. The small business taxes calculator covers LLCs, S-corps, and sole proprietorships, while the sales tax calculator and VAT calculator support retail and service businesses. Our company car tax calculator addresses fringe benefit taxation, and the payroll deductions online calculator handles wage garnishments and benefit contributions. For employees, the paycheck calculator with overtime, biweekly paycheck calculator, and monthly paycheck calculator provide clear breakdowns of earnings after taxes.</p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">International and Retirement Tax Calculators</h3>
          <p>International taxpayers benefit from country-specific tools including the hmrc tax calculator for UK PAYE and National Insurance, the ato tax calculator for Australian income tax, the cra payroll calculator for Canadian deductions, and the bir tax calculator for Philippines taxes. Each international calculator incorporates local tax slabs, social security contributions, and standard deductions. For retirement planning, our IRA to Roth conversion calculator, 401k withdrawal tax calculator, and pension tax calculator estimate the tax impact of distributions and conversions, helping you maximize retirement savings while minimizing tax liability.</p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-on-primary">Privacy-First, Always Free</h3>
          <p>Every tool in our suite respects your privacy. All calculations run locally in your browser using JavaScript, meaning no financial data is ever transmitted to our servers. Whether you use the turbotax calculator alternatives, our simple tax return calculator, or the advanced estate tax calculator, you can trust that your information stays on your device. Our free tax calculator is accessible on desktop and mobile devices without registration, making it easy to estimate your tax return, plan your refund, or calculate your paycheck whenever you need it. From estimating your monthly tax payment with the paycheck tax calculator to planning your year-end obligation with the annual tax calculator, TaxPortal provides reliable, browser-based tax computation for every scenario.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-hairline bg-canvas-soft dark:border-overlay-light dark:bg-canvas">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
