            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Income Tax Calculator</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Estimate federal and state income tax, effective tax rate, and take-home pay for multiple countries and tax years including 2022, 2023, and 2024.</p>
          </a>
