            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Payroll Calculator</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Calculate payroll taxes, employer contributions, federal withholding, and net pay with our free online payroll calculator.</p>
          </a>
