            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Tax Refund Estimator</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Estimate your tax refund amount, tax return estimate, and refund eligibility with our accurate refund calculator.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/countries" class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:dark:hover:border-primary">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Capital Gains Tax Calculator</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Calculate short-term and long-term capital gains tax on stocks, real estate, and property sales with our capital gains calculator.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/countries" class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Self Employment Tax Calculator</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Estimate self-employment tax, 1099 income tax, and quarterly estimated tax payments for freelancers and independent contractors.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="/countries" class="rounded-xl border border-hairline bg-canvas p-6 hover:border-primary transition dark:border-overlay-lighter dark:bg-surface dark:hover:border-primary">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Sales Tax & VAT Calculator</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted">Calculate sales tax, VAT, and GST on purchases and transactions with our free sales tax calculator and VAT calculator.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-hairline dark:border-overlay-light">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-ink mb-8 dark:text-on-primary">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">How much tax will I pay calculator?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">Our free tax calculator estimates your tax liability based on your income, deductions, filing status, and location. Simply enter your details to see federal, state, and local taxes. The calculator supports multiple tax years including 2022, 2023, and 2024, making it easy to estimate your tax return, plan your refund, or calculate your take-home pay with our income tax calculator and payroll calculator tools.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">How do I calculate my tax liability?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">To calculate your tax liability, start with your total income from all sources including salary, freelance earnings, and investments. Subtract allowable deductions such as the standard deduction or itemized deductions to arrive at your taxable income. Apply the current tax slab rates to determine your income tax. Use our tax bracket calculator and effective tax rate calculator to understand your marginal rate and total tax burden. For accurate results, use our free income tax calculator which automatically applies the latest tax rates and credits.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">What is an income tax calculator?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">An income tax calculator is an online tool that estimates your tax obligation based on your earnings, deductions, and applicable tax laws. Our free tax calculator supports federal income tax, state income tax, and international tax calculations. Whether you need a simple tax estimator or a detailed tax return calculator, our tool provides accurate results based on the latest tax slabs and IRS guidelines without requiring any personal information.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">What is the ClearTax income tax calculator?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">ClearTax is a popular tax preparation platform that offers income tax filing and calculator services, primarily for Indian taxpayers. Our tax calculator provides similar functionality with broader international support, including hmrc tax calculator, ato tax calculator, and cra payroll calculator for users in the UK, Australia, Canada, and beyond. Use our free tax calculator for accurate estimates across multiple jurisdictions.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">How to use Groww's income tax calculator?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">Groww is an investment platform that provides basic tax estimation for mutual fund and stock investments. Our comprehensive income tax calculator goes further by supporting all income types including salary, business income, capital gains, and freelance earnings. Simply enter your income details, select your tax regime, and review the instant breakdown of tax liability, effective tax rate, and take-home pay.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">How do I calculate income tax online?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">Calculating income tax online is simple with our free tax calculator. Navigate to the income tax calculator section, enter your annual income, select your filing status and tax year, and input any applicable deductions or credits. Our tax estimator instantly computes your federal tax, state tax, total tax liability, effective tax rate, and take-home pay. All calculations are performed locally in your browser for complete privacy.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Which is better – old tax regime or new tax regime?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">The choice between old and new tax regimes depends on your deductions and income level. Use our old vs new tax regime calculator to compare your total tax liability under both systems. Taxpayers with significant deductions such as home loan interest, HRA, and Section 80C investments often benefit from the old regime, while those with fewer deductions may prefer the new regime's lower slab rates. Our tax estimator shows the exact difference so you can choose wisely.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">How can I save tax using deductions?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">You can save tax by claiming all eligible deductions and credits. Common deductions include the standard deduction, mortgage interest, state and local taxes, charitable contributions, and retirement account contributions. Use our taxable income calculator and AGI calculator to see how deductions lower your tax base. Our tax refund estimator also factors in tax credits such as the Earned Income Tax Credit, Child Tax Credit, and education credits to maximize your refund.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">What are the current income tax slab rates?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">Current income tax slab rates vary by country, filing status, and tax year. In the United States, federal tax brackets for 2023 range from 10% to 37%. Other countries have their own progressive tax systems with different thresholds. Our income tax calculator automatically applies the correct slab rates for your selected jurisdiction and tax year, including 2022, 2023, and 2024 rates, so you always get an accurate estimate without manually looking up tax tables.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">How do I calculate tax on salary?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">To calculate tax on salary, enter your gross salary into our salary tax calculator along with any allowances, bonuses, and deductions. The tool applies the relevant PAYE rates, FICA taxes, and any applicable state or local taxes. For monthly calculations, use the monthly tax calculator or weekly tax calculator. The paycheck calculator with overtime and bonus tax calculator handle supplemental income correctly, ensuring accurate take-home pay estimates.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">Can I use a tax calculator for advance tax payments?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">Yes, our estimated tax payments calculator is specifically designed to help you calculate quarterly advance tax installments. Enter your projected annual income, deductions, and withholding to see your total estimated tax liability and the amount due for each quarterly payment. This is especially useful for self-employed individuals, freelancers, and investors who do not have tax withheld from their income. Use our quarterly tax calculator to avoid underpayment penalties.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink mb-2 dark:text-on-primary">What is the best tax calculator?</h3>
            <p class="text-body dark:text-muted">The best tax calculator is accurate, up-to-date, privacy-focused, and supports your specific jurisdiction and tax situation. Our free tax calculator meets all these criteria by using the latest tax laws and rates, performing all calculations locally in your browser, and supporting everything from simple income tax estimation to complex scenarios like capital gains, self-employment tax, payroll taxes, and international taxes. Whether you need a turbotax calculator alternative, a paycheck estimator, or a tax refund estimator for 2023, TaxPortal delivers reliable results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

